1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,040
Hello, Mr. Duvall.

2
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:04,500
This is Tony from the Reservations Department at the National Opera.

3
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:10,325
I received your message, and I want to answer your queries regarding the performance tomorrow.

4
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:18,180
As you know, Thursday is a popular night, so I suggest that you book immediately and pay for your tickets before 5 p.m. this evening.

5
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:26,200
As for a group booking, at present, there are fifteen seats available to your group, but unfortunately they are not all together.

6
00:00:26,795 --> 00:00:28,340
I am hoping that this will be okay.

7
00:00:29,175 --> 00:00:34,580
Anyway, if you do decide to take these tickets, I can offer you a generous group discount of 20 percent.

8
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:41,460
All you need to do is call me to confirm and then come in to the reservations office to pick up your tickets.

9
00:00:42,230 --> 00:00:43,240
I hope you have a nice evening.
